  "description": "A girl from the La Veda Republic. One day she was attacked by a thief, and later rescued by one of the Six Heroes, Atro. Having fallen in love at first sight with Atro, she undertook a rigorous examination to enter knighthood in order to learn the art of the sword from Atro himself. However, after becoming a part of the order, she then discovered that Atro was not a member of the knighthood there. Heartbroken, Will, the leader of the knights, tried to comfort her by stating that \"her form with a bow was a thing of beauty.\" Somehow misunderstanding, she took up the bow and one year later had already become the best archer in the republic.",
  "summon": "Ahhh! That hurt!<br> Oh, wonderful Summoner...<br>I'll become your ally!",
